## Model card (verified facts only)

- **Name:** Gemini 3.1 Flash
- **Short description:** Google DeepMind's updated Flash-tier model of the Gemini 3 generation, announced 2026-01-29 — Pro-level intelligence at Flash speed and pricing.
- **Provider / access:** Google Gemini API / Vertex AI — `gemini-3.1-flash` (Chat Completions-style generateContent API).
- **Release / knowledge:** Announced 2026-01-29; knowledge cutoff January 2025 (per Gemini 3 developer guide family table).
- **IDs:** `google/gemini-3.1-flash` (Vertex), `gemini-3.1-flash` (Gemini API / AI Studio). No Zen Free ID — paid only.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens input; 64K max output.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, audio, video in; text out; reasoning yes; tool calls, structured outputs, caching, search grounding.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-27):** $0.50/M in, $3.00/M out (per Gemini 3 developer guide pricing table).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; no public parameter count.

